<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes are now a major source of fatalities, with Sudan drones responsible for nearly three quarters of war deaths this year and South Sudan accusing Sudan of a drone attack that killed scores in a disputed area. A priest who had fled South Sudan was murdered in Birmingham, and a pastor was jailed in South Sudan for performing a Christian song with musical instruments. The government screened out 54 children from a police recruitment drive, and SPLM Jonglei chairperson candidates began their race without primaries in Pigi County, while a chairperson was injured in a road incident. Protesters demanded inclusion in the UNISFA mandate drafting, and UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUzVVZlh0cUIxWFBYU2NGYnZWdHZmc1RLY3oyNm51NTlQQjJEMFlVclNsN2tWM0FjMmRycVdsMXQ2WW4xeUJZYVR1V3lac2ZBTmJ4RWcxYXVxaFlGV1dNbXM3OG5FOXhheVdiM0dzUVktZnJZZkQxNUU4ZWZuM0lWV2JyZXVKUXZtcDl2RHVaTVRtRGN1ZFdPckdPQ0dZSFI1SDVfVGlPbWhYa0o0alNCNFdsSDgtUkhxakRWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUlRPWTRXaUJNbnhCWU44RUhYNFVoV1FKU1UxWTB1T2dQLXJYSHA5OVhuVkJSNkM2U2tacHd1a1RDcXRNYjJ6SjNUNHpPdkIybE9YUENPaW5vOGJYMXFfV0hWSkxackkweXlXTWZqNGwyczMtaGhabkQyUjN2Q0R1RkZ2TDgxSkFCSXRBTXpORFRLRUY3U2Vwbm9DSW5ZVWhNZE1ZRk1qaHZkRjJaMVhlZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNMzB2NXNqalg1Z21peWN4V01reXNTRUk0ZGh1elQ3cXM1WWNGLXZ5emMzUllHM1lGUDlXeExsZV9faDRqUC1HeHVHb2NaaW52eUJVdFIzaUY4WWxETnBTcE45U3A0MkQybDYwdWI3aVFfMTRUVW1xVVN2MHNLVVU5TTgwczhiRGtQNVl4WGx2NFJhNGlDNmg2REJnZGkzQjZ4ckE0cFdoRDRLQ1VxTm1rSTdRdTZpcTQwWGhTYWNvZUFIVUJjQ1hN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Citizen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr